{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"像是忽然被一件很重要、却还说不清是什么的事攫住了：郑重甚至有些沉重，同时又迟疑、茫然。偶尔仿佛已经碰到一点可以相信的东西，却还不足以真正安定下来。\",\"thread\":\"这里最先发生的不是明白，而是在明白以前就已经无法漠不关心。人已经感到这件事对自己有分量，因此会认真地靠近它；可每次以为自己快能抓住它时，所得又不足以容纳那份最初的重量。于是迟疑不是因为没有所求，而恰恰因为所求已经真实存在，却还没有清楚到能够被安顿。那些短暂的近乎确定，也没有消除这种不安，反而让人知道自己确实在寻找某种可以成立的东西。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"有一件尚未被说清的事，已经被确认具有不能轻轻放下的分量。\",\"第一次试图获得明确的把握并没有真正安顿这种分量：接近确定与真正得到确定之间仍有距离。\",\"短暂的近乎确定使这种困扰不再只是空茫；人已经知道，自己确实在寻找某种能够成立的东西。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4d97276b-f1b9-416a-ba09-236f6be94b4c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224030836605Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.437, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:40:52.281891+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "09b1dd142c8a6d2422d2cc4921d18e9baac3d5af74046db623430fea69f2acf1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388